53,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":1},"text":"可以说说你长大的地方是怎么样的吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028807991529746807"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028807734460920206","created_at":"2026-03-03T12:20:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028807734460920206"],"id":"2028807734460920206","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":10046,"like_count":257,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":26},"text":"人与人之间还是该停在赏味期，不要深入交流，不要了解我的喜恶和习惯，保持着恰到好处的距离，也许会显得生疏，但起码不会有争吵，你还觉得我可爱。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028807734460920206"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028804347170365914","created_at":"2026-03-03T12:07:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028804347170365914"],"id":"2028804347170365914","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1131,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近都微妙的嘴痒但不知道吃啥 一忙就更容易食欲减退 啊啊啊啊啊每天不知道吃什么就纯粹生命体征维持中","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028804347170365914"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028803430547132564","created_at":"2026-03-03T12:03:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028803430547132564"],"id":"2028803430547132564","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":578,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我的脾气像摔炮，很响但是没什么伤害","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028803430547132564"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028803107728278010","created_at":"2026-03-03T12:02:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028803107728278010"],"id":"2028803107728278010","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1315,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我每次占卜完之后都会真心实意地祝每个人幸福……","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028803107728278010"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028802674523803821","created_at":"2026-03-03T12:00:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028802674523803821"],"id":"2028802674523803821","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2060,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"穷的想把校长老师同学都卖掉。。。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028802674523803821"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028798622750662741","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:44:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028798622750662741"],"id":"2028798622750662741","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1153,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"虽然我是靠着恋爱脑吃饭，可是看见客妹掉下的眼泪，我又不忍心起来，只是斟酌着说得更委婉。我总是希望她的眼泪少一点再少一点，所以看结束的最后我都会真心祝福所有感情不如意的小女孩一句：“希望下次听到的是你幸福的消息。”可是虚无的祝福得不到真实的幸福","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028798622750662741"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028797584706531774","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:40:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028797584706531774"],"id":"2028797584706531774","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":570,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"太好心就会被所有人骑在头上而一个脑残却可以向所有人发癫","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028797584706531774"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028795583511834950","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:32:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028795583511834950"],"id":"2028795583511834950","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":518,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看不懂自己在说什么正常吗。。其实我也听不懂我说话，你们居然可以和我正常对话太神奇了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028795583511834950"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028795466847256700","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:31:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028795466847256700"],"id":"2028795466847256700","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":78355,"like_count":1508,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":236},"text":"我希望我的黑名单可以起到一个死亡笔记的作用","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028795466847256700"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028793856557559970","created_at":"2026-03-03T11:25:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028793856557559970"],"id":"2028793856557559970","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1567,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"重要通知：\n请元宵节晚上赏月的朋友把赏月费打款到我账户，每人16元收费。按国家规定执行：十五的月亮16元，谢谢","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028793856557559970"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028728304770183548","created_at":"2026-03-03T07:04:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028728304770183548"],"id":"2028728304770183548","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":29327,"like_count":305,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":27},"text":"一段有效的感情就是让你在结束之后五十年内不想跟任何人类产生类似的情感连结","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028728304770183548"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028543717746102520","created_at":"2026-03-02T18:51:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028543717746102520"],"id":"2028543717746102520","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":631,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我发现你们都属于那种在路边见到我觉得我特别可爱又有趣，所以都想把我捞回去养着的人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028543717746102520"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028543300756795864","created_at":"2026-03-02T18:49:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2028543300756795864"],"id":"2028543300756795864","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1097,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"总是把我塑成闷闷的，像会躲在角落生闷气掉眼泪的小黑猫猫。何尝不是一种嬤。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2028543300756795864"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2028534376288665731","created_at":"2026-03-02T18:14:18.000